  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Urban Resilience to Climate Extremes in Southeast Asia</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support to weather and climate services with the aim of disaster preparedness and risk reduction in Asia. Myanmar (until 2021) and Vietnam have been main recipient countries.</narrative>
